From 80048ab9be8cfd614a9701ce5aaa7f1a7427e740 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooz <136268860+y-o-o-z@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:04:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] local: web view like the erssi terminal, shellter polish
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- sender column as wide as the longest nick in the window (4-16 chars,
  Geist Mono), so short nicks leave no gap after the time
- time without brackets, as in the terminal
- erssi lines ("erssi │ ...", "· │ ...") show their source in the
  sender column; the column stays for lines without a sender
- the old trackbar line (────) from the journal is not shown
- shellter: readable hover in the light sidebar, dark inputs and nick
  list header, buttons in sentence case, theme accent for checkboxes,
  code and focus, mIRC colors 0-15 readable on both backgrounds,
  separators in theme colors, space after the time on phones

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
